  "exactPageBlockText": "如果$a<0$, 那么$-a>0$, $a\\sqrt{2}=-(-a)\\sqrt{2}↵=\\sqrt{(-a)^2}\\cdot\\sqrt{2}=-\\sqrt{a^2}\\cdot\\sqrt{2}=-\\sqrt{2a^2}$.",
  "exactPageFormulaWithPhysicalWrapMarker": "$a\\sqrt{2}=-(-a)\\sqrt{2}↵=\\sqrt{(-a)^2}\\cdot\\sqrt{2}=-\\sqrt{a^2}\\cdot\\sqrt{2}=-\\sqrt{2a^2}$",
  "original": "$a\\sqrt{2}=-(-a)\\sqrt{2}=\\sqrt{(-a)^2}\\cdot\\sqrt{2}=-\\sqrt{a^2}\\cdot\\sqrt{2}=-\\sqrt{2a^2}$",
  "corrected": "$a\\sqrt{2}=-(-a)\\sqrt{2}=-\\sqrt{(-a)^2}\\cdot\\sqrt{2}=-\\sqrt{a^2}\\cdot\\sqrt{2}=-\\sqrt{2a^2}$",
  "reason": "For a<0, sqrt((-a)^2)=|-a|=-a>0. The preceding -(-a)*sqrt(2) is negative, so its conversion must be -sqrt((-a)^2)*sqrt(2), not the positive printed term. Substitution a=-1 changes the printed chain from -sqrt(2) to +sqrt(2) and back; adding the missing minus keeps all five terms -sqrt(2).",
